window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>The continent is engulfed in war, and the Firelanders are hunting an ancient weapon that could tip the balance.</p> <p>Since ascending to the throne, my life has been anything but easy. A shadowy puppet master is fueling the conflict between Manzano and Illythia, driving both nations toward ruin. In the south, Vivienne is my unlikely ally, but the beautiful blonde has made it clear that her loyalty comes at a cost I may not be ready to pay.</p> <p>As if that weren’t enough, my former mentor Dario has embarked on a dangerous quest to claim the Orb of Light, a relic of unimaginable power. His goal? To awaken the Supreme Fire Lord, unleashing a reign of chaos and destruction unlike anything the world has seen.</p> <p>The continent is desperate for a leader to unite them in this time of turmoil. I'll rise to the challenge—and I won’t let them down.</p>"; 
